<div type="letter">
<div type="address">
<ab>

</ab>
</div>
 
<div type="mainBody">
<p>Slow progress continues hope crisis now past sincerest thanks for your solicitude during <seg xml:id="seg1" type="note-anchor">these bad days</seg> please convey thanks also to <name type="person" key="schi68">Mr Schiff</name> kindest regards <name type="person" key="joyc82">James Joyce</name>
                    </p>
</div>
</div>


<div type="notes">
<note xml:id="note1" target="#seg1" type="commentary">
                    <name type="person" key="joyc82">JJ</name> confronted various health challenges in <date when="1922-07">July 1922</date>, including his long-standing eye problems and an arthritic back. Dr Louis Berman, a visiting New York endocrinologist, examined JJ in <name type="geo" key="G_FRA_PARI">Paris</name> and advised extraction of his teeth and endocrine treatment for his arthritic back. JJ postponed the former, awaiting consultation with his Paris ophthalmologist Dr Louis Borsch, and ultimately travelled to <name type="geo" key="G_GBR_LOND">London</name> in <date when="1922-08">August 1922</date>.</note>
</div>

      </body>
